<title>USA: Quaker Fabric Corp Q3 net income jumps.</title>
<headline>Quaker Fabric Corp Q3 net income jumps.</headline>
<dateline>FALL RIVER, Mass. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>THREE MONTHS ENDED		   SEPT. 28, SEPT. 30,  PERCENT</p>
<p>						    1996     1995  Change</p>
<p> Net sales				     $46,436 $37,984  22.3%</p>
<p> Gross margin				   10,751   7,344   46.4</p>
<p> Operating income				4,053   1,630  148.7</p>
<p> Net income					1,999     498  301.4</p>
